{
    "title": "Drive Ahead! - Fun Car Battles",
    "description": "Online PvP against drivers from all over the world in up to crazy 8 Player matches! Challenge your friends, queue up and battle it out in 2v2, 3v3 or even 4v4 quick fire duels in our real-time multiplayer mayhem mode, \"Friendzone\" !\r\nOrganise your own tournament with private multiplayer rooms and invite your friends no matter where they may be, the fun never stops!\r\n\r\nWatch your head in gladiator car fights! In this game you knock your friend in the head with a stunt driving cars to score. We guarantee crazy casual and ranked multiplayer motor sports fun with friends.\r\n\r\nCollect over 300 stylized racing cars and push the pedal to metal to master increasingly dangerous battle arenas. We got off-road vehicles, monster trucks, tanks, motorcycle stunt cars and more. Some of the rides are quite out of this world, like the ghost pirate ship, electric reindeer or Mini-T-Rex with an actual gun\u2026 Buckle up and build your car battle team any way you like. Team up with friends in crews. Level-up and power-up to face other teams and horrific Bosses.\r\n\r\nFeel the adrenaline, grab the wheel and become a Master Car Gladiator! This may be a casual game, but it has tons of content to unlock and game modes to master.\r\n\r\n- The Battle Arena is the place where racing champions are made! Clash with friends in quick-fire 2-player fights\r\n- Team up with guild mates in crews. Crush other teams on the leader boards and lead your crew to victory in co-op racing challenges.\r\n- Pick a ride to take a road trip to face adventure and crash into adversaries. Perfect your skills controlling these cartoony pixel art cars.\r\n- Share your high scores and most hilarious moments with our active video community. Get your clip featured in our social tab and become famous drift racer.\r\n- Check out daily stunts, there\u2019s new quests to complete every day.\r\n- Face new universes in Rift Riders Boss fights ever week and race for glory.\r\n- How long can you reign in King of the Hill against an endless flow of opponents before you go kaboom?\r\n\r\n- Explore exotic stylized Mission Stadiums for amazing rewards and non-stop action, while avoiding hazards like robots, aliens and penguins. Seriously, the penguins are the most dangerous.\r\n\r\nHundreds of pixel cars, helmets, levels, missions, and game modes bring endless hours of helmet-crashing two-player racing action with freak accidents!\r\n\r\nJust be careful not to wreck yourself!\r\n\r\nYou can email us at driveahead [at] dodreams [dot] com. Here is our Privacy Policy: https://www.dodreams.com/termsofserviceprivacypolicy\r\n\r\nAre you enjoying Drive Ahead? Help us make more fun games like this by rating and reviewing it!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Online PvP against drivers from all over the world in up to crazy 8 Player matches! Challenge your friends, queue up and battle it out in 2v2, 3v3 or even 4v4 quick fire duels in our real-time multiplayer mayhem mode, &quot;Friendzone&quot; !<br>Organise your own tournament with private multiplayer rooms and invite your friends no matter where they may be, the fun never stops!<br><br>Watch your head in gladiator car fights! In this game you knock your friend in the head with a stunt driving cars to score. We guarantee crazy casual and ranked multiplayer motor sports fun with friends.<br><br>Collect over 300 stylized racing cars and push the pedal to metal to master increasingly dangerous battle arenas. We got off-road vehicles, monster trucks, tanks, motorcycle stunt cars and more. Some of the rides are quite out of this world, like the ghost pirate ship, electric reindeer or Mini-T-Rex with an actual gun\u2026 Buckle up and build your car battle team any way you like. Team up with friends in crews. Level-up and power-up to face other teams and horrific Bosses.<br><br>Feel the adrenaline, grab the wheel and become a Master Car Gladiator! This may be a casual game, but it has tons of content to unlock and game modes to master.<br><br>- The Battle Arena is the place where racing champions are made! Clash with friends in quick-fire 2-player fights<br>- Team up with guild mates in crews. Crush other teams on the leader boards and lead your crew to victory in co-op racing challenges.<br>- Pick a ride to take a road trip to face adventure and crash into adversaries. Perfect your skills controlling these cartoony pixel art cars.<br>- Share your high scores and most hilarious moments with our active video community. Get your clip featured in our social tab and become famous drift racer.<br>- Check out daily stunts, there\u2019s new quests to complete every day.<br>- Face new universes in Rift Riders Boss fights ever week and race for glory.<br>- How long can you reign in King of the Hill against an endless flow of opponents before you go kaboom?<br><br>- Explore exotic stylized Mission Stadiums for amazing rewards and non-stop action, while avoiding hazards like robots, aliens and penguins. Seriously, the penguins are the most dangerous.<br><br>Hundreds of pixel cars, helmets, levels, missions, and game modes bring endless hours of helmet-crashing two-player racing action with freak accidents!<br><br>Just be careful not to wreck yourself!<br><br>You can email us at driveahead [at] dodreams [dot] com. Here is our Privacy Policy: https://www.dodreams.com/termsofserviceprivacypolicy<br><br>Are you enjoying Drive Ahead? Help us make more fun games like this by rating and reviewing it!",
